onsibilities - Operate in Compliance (26 TAC §746.1003(1))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1377269-i20211208-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1003-5","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1377269-i20211208","date":"2021-12-08","original_code":"746.1003(5)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-02-17","finding":"Director Responsibilities - Direct Care for No More Than 10 Hours: It was determined that caregivers were in direct care of children for more than 10 hours a day.","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026681836","violation_type_title":"Director Responsibilities - Direct Care for No More Than 10 Hours (26 TAC §746.1003(5))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1377269-i20211208-v3","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1203-4","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1377269-i20211208","date":"2021-12-08","original_code":"746.1203(4)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-02-17","finding":"Responsibilities of Caregivers- Supervision of Children: It was determined that a caregiver failed to adequality supervise the children in care, when a child was able to walk out of the playground gate onto a busy street.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026697740","violation_type_title":"Responsibilities of Caregivers - Supervision of Children (26 TAC §746.1203(4))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1377269-i20211208-v4","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1203-2","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1377269-i20211208","date":"2021-12-08","original_code":"746.1203(2)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-02-17","finding":"Responsibilities of Caregivers - Know Group Responsible For: A two year old child was able to leave the playground area without the caregivers knowledge. The child was gone for approximately 15 minutes. The car